BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Resident Evil
DTSTART:20260919T193000Z
DTEND:20260919T211500Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T193000Z
UID:NwnUs5E1CP
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nFrom the mind of visionary filmma
 ker Zach Cregger (Weapons\, Barbarian) comes a thrilling — and terrify
 ing — reinvention of the Resident Evil franchise. In an all-new story\
 , Resident Evil follows Bryan (Austin Abrams)\, a medical courier who un
 wittingly finds himself in an action-packed\, non-stop race for survival a
 s one fateful\, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/resident-evil\n\nEstimated start: 12:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
